{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:576f377fce860e295ff106c07a591e78bdc6cc57daeb5d2a32911e7083453f30",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22",
      "text": "课程结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d2dbfbe119fdc28b8b9e219ff28eaefbeefd5e87d58a58899457f27a36e589b",
      "text": "三个人都辛苦了！\n明天也保持这个状态继续加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c521a402617be94fa629534adc91688ecb40c5ab08146c720f0c6a819bbea320",
      "text": "……对舞蹈的自信果然不是吹出来的啊。\n挺能干的嘛，翔太。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31bd6d6ee51ac0ed4851698b2ab58eef0434b4c6f738787f10b58d8253815c70",
      "text": "你那边也挺不错的嘛？\n嘛，不过大概永远都比不上我就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9d5df7b230493d076b5a23bfc283ab3599c0f08132c15b8dd247a6b2b91e577",
      "text": "真是的，嘴上真是不饶人啊。\n厉害的事情确实厉害，我承认就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15ab667537ecd01717df2d44f694c3ad7d710397c8db8eaf8c2a96461251b668",
      "text": "但总有一天，\n我绝对会把你甩在身后的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7159c7fc4b40540cf822293313332f9ecfc0b974d6d3c8440eb6efa9bfba023",
      "text": "冬马、翔太。打扰你们聊天不好意思啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9116c0db6b703594ba894c31c461afb68a45c915924e8c947e6666e71a488434",
      "text": "好像有巴士可以送我们回家，\n差不多该去换衣服了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000114:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537fe72a1ff4885482a72463b9b87294e8ddbfb2c466aea156677c6022b47bd5",
      "text": "呼……呼……呼噜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13e48787706959b66ec3450eeea5401ecde8efd9d54e4280df2b4a5e712b260b",
      "text": "翔太。快到家了，该醒醒了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b73491dd41dccd412808f09fb6f2681bb9fac2c3916f84aefc655e3f3642680e",
      "text": "唔——……不要，再睡10分钟…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57cdd389e021a1c2bf36a859cac2d1f705addfe63f97b0877161d5f52a0ecbd6",
      "text": "不行啊，完全没有要醒的样子。\n……哎，聊着聊着好像已经到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_02_1_1_001_02:1_1_001_02_b:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5ea617bd49430da16ea6582f13b9a5a513c18d8880b0accb0ec76886c209136",
      "text": "这家伙，起床气也太重了吧……\n嗯？屋里有人出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
